Work Needed.
------------
	Some older areas will be removed, being replaced by newer, and better
	files of higher standard and quality. Casti and Nae will head this
	operation, with aid from other SENIOR and ELDER creators. As this
	occurs, it will be important that new code from current creators be
	made to compensate. If you would like to do this type of work,
	please code in your own directory. Talk to a QC person about what
	kinds of things need coding, and they should be able to help.

